      "priority_overridden": false,
      "ai_priority_reasoning": "Book listed as unavailable on primary retail channels, causing immediate lost sales.",
      "ai_draft_response": "Dear Priya Sharma,\n\nThank you for bringing the availability of \"Whispers of the Ganges\" to our attention. We understand how frustrating it is when readers cannot purchase your book.\n\nWhen a published title shows as \"Currently Unavailable\" on Amazon or Flipkart, it usually indicates a temporary inventory sync glitch between our fulfillment partners (In-House / Repro India) and the retail catalog.\n\nWe have triggered an immediate manual stock re-sync with the distribution channels. Per our experience, listings typically reactivate and show live inventory within 24–48 hours.\n\nWe will monitor the listing closely and update you as soon as the buy button is active again.\n\nWarm regards,\nBookLeaf Distribution Desk",
